d":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"职位描述：负责研华嵌入式产品技术支持工作，包括且不限于：嵌入式板卡(X86/ARM)问题复现、分析(debug)、解决；现场技术支持；技术文档编写等。\n\n技能需求：\n1、\t接触并使用Linux，包括基本概念的理解，和相关命令的使用。\n2、\t对电脑主机硬件有所掌握，熟悉X86/ARM外围电路,并掌握相关调试工具使用和技巧。\n3、\t看懂原理图，PCB，此为工作中必要的内容。或者有电子相关背景，能通过培训迅速掌握此技能。同时熟悉相关IDE的使用。\n4、\t掌握C语言，有C语言相关编程经验者为佳。 有接触或者有相关“Linux内核/Linux BSP”调试或开发者为佳。\n5、\t有钻研精神和团队意识；保持不断学习，积极向上。","Require":"职能描述：\n1、\t解决技术问题，如嵌入式板卡相关的“问题复现，问题调试，和问题解决”。\n2、\t负责ARM/X86相关产品的技术支持工作，解决嵌入式板卡，软件，linux BSP 使用和开发过程中遇到的技术问题。\n3、\t支援业务团队，梳理客户项目技术需求，根据客户的应用环境提供相应的解决问题的方法或方案。\n4、\t技术文档的编写。\n5、\t3—10年不等工作经验。\n\n职位竞争优势：\n1、\t平台广阔，除了inte和AMD的CPU外，还能接触到各类主流的ARM CPU平台，如：RK，NXP，TI等。\n2、\t可以在嵌入式团队中成长，个人技术能不断得到深入和提高。\n3、\t人才培养，致力于把该职位人员培养成技术专家。也可以根据个人的发展方向，往项目管理，销售，产品等方面进行渗透。","ClassificationOne":"技术类","ClassificationTwo":"上海分公司","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-10-13T10:49:04","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0